From 7a47be1b3f611677b51a0daf58f2ffdbdad3f75c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Rinehart <johnrichardrinehart@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:15:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] niri: pin smithay master and the drm-extras fork

Smithay master has fixes that the pinned Smithay revision lacks. The
late-CRTC mapping fix for smithay-drm-extras is not in Smithay yet
(Smithay/smithay#2125).

Pin smithay to the Smithay master tip. Take smithay-drm-extras from the
fork branch that carries the late-CRTC mapping fix.
---
